TI  - Quantitative Analysis of Multi-Elements in a Micron-Sized Single Particle Based on Laser-Induced Breakdown Spectroscopy Signal Enhancement of an Optical Fiber Collimated System
T2  - ANALYTICAL CHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - VARIABLE SELECTION
KW  - TRAPPING-LIBS
