TI  - A 23-year nationwide study revealing aerosol-driven light rain shifts in China's emission control era
T2  - ATMOSPHERIC CHEMISTRY AND PHYSICS
LA  - English
KW  - PRECIPITATION
KW  - IMPACT
KW  - CLIMATE
