TI  - Temporal Shifts in Climate-Influenza Dynamics: A Multi-Subtype Analysis in Southern China Spanning the COVID-19 Era
T2  - TRANSBOUNDARY AND EMERGING DISEASES
LA  - English
KW  - climate-influenza interactions
KW  - COVID-19 pandemic
KW  - Southern China
