TI  - A Novel Hybrid Approach: Integrating Bayesian SPDE and Deep Learning for Enhanced Spatiotemporal Modeling of PM2.5 Concentrations in Urban Airsheds for Sustainable Climate Action and Public Health
T2  - SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - PM2.5 concentrations
