TI  - Does COVID-19 lockdown matter for air pollution in the short and long run in China? A machine learning approach to policy evaluation
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Public health emergencies
KW  - COVID-19
KW  - Air pollution governance
KW  - Deweathering machine learning technique
KW  - Random forest model (RF model)
