TI  - Development of an Atopic Dermatitis Incidence Rate Prediction Model for South Korea Using Air Pollutants Big Data: Comparisons Between Regression and Artificial Neural Network
T2  - KOREAN JOURNAL OF CHEMICAL ENGINEERING
